{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ay55in","slide":5,"text":"The final result has 2,977 objects seen in both 7DT and FINALCAT. It also has 16,512 objects found only in 7DT, and 55,770 found only in FINALCAT. Together, they form a union catalog of 75,259 objects. The main points are simple. The 7DT matches use the position error of each band. The internal position check is strong. The FINALCAT radius has a chance-match test behind it. This catalog is ready for the next photo-z analysis. Thank you.\n\nSource: presentation/2026-10-02/matching_presentation_plan.md; output/COSMOS1/singlebandphot/matching/figures/master_population_summary.png."}